Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.19,0:00:07.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to walk anymore!\NPull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piggyback!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Inaba, could you help me out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an2}Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her desires got unleashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't care. Handle it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you stop fooling around?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:28.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaegashi-kun, if you use this field trip as cover to do anything weird to Nagase-san, I'll have your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:30.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't make me sound like a bad guy!{Don't make me sound like a rapist!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:36.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piggyback!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:39.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't there something in your heart that's just as important?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:42.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase, quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Inaba, help me!\NInaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:30.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Having to use this old equipment is making me one hell of an {\i1}angry{\i0} camper.\NSorry. It's my fault for losing at rock-paper-scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:33.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.34,0:02:37.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need to make it up to us somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watase-kun, could you think of something for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.59,0:02:41.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:41.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:47.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This kind of stuff makes for good memories later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:47.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Inaban?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need memories of doing crap that I didn't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:00.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are you so bad at rock-paper-scissors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lost against Iori and Watase in {\i1}every game{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:09.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got the worst luck on this morning's TV horoscope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That might have something to do with it.\NWhoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:16.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd probably die if you fell from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Mr. Misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}You'd have to go out of your way to actually fall from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you smiling for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:30.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were all depressed just a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No reason. It feels like it's been a while since we talked like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:37.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? It's not a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:03:56.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder how those three are doing.\NThey should be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:04:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, it looks like Inaba-chan is almost back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, about that apron...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, long hair and an apron make an absolutely divine combination!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:13.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I'm amazed at how laid-back you can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:16.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you born this way or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're good at this, Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:21.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cook a lot at home, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:30.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Inaba... could be better.\NCrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:32.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I get in the zone, I'm freaking crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:39.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Need me to show you?\ND-Did I strike a chord?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:40.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An unleashed desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:44.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Iori, don't think you've won just because Taichi said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.34,0:04:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is this about me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.97,0:04:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see who can cut these things faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:56.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Do I have to do it, too?\NDon't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.39,0:04:57.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're done washing the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, looks like you've made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:03.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Putting you in the same group was the right idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:07.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:18.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that long enough, Fujishima-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:25.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why can't we eat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:28.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the other groups are eating already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:32.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm adding the last bit of my own original spice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:32.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were so finicky when it came to food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:41.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just when it involves curry.\NWhy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:48.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The greatest spice is hunger—I mean, love!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.03,0:05:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too good! I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Love, right? Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:02.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:07.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope the love you're talking about isn't {\i1}that{\i0} kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:07.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows?\NBy the way, Nagase-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:10.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's rice on your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.01,0:06:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's focus on eating, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:26.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:30.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd go on a field trip every day for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:34.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Inaban—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:41.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Inaba! Are you bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:44.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look! Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if it gets infected?\NI can take care of myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:54.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone have a band-aid?\NOh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I brought my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Nagase...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:14.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just mind your own business...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:38.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it, Iori?\NInaban, are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you in love with...\NWait, Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:52.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She found out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:55.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She found out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:04.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder where those two went.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:29.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban!\NTell me... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:40.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you... in love with Taichi... too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:55.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You kept trying to get me and Taichi together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, I knew you loved Taichi, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:03.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I thought it was just as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:09.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you want to get me and Taichi together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.69,0:09:12.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you just going to let me have him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are going to tell me why right now, Inaba Himeko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori, did your—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me!\NTell me! Tell me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you won't, then we're no longer friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because...\NBecause if I didn't, we couldn't stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:37.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't we be able to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because... when it comes to guys and girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:44.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if love and stuff got mixed in, we'd be bound to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:48.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our friendship wouldn't even stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.69,0:09:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki loves Yui,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and in spite of what Yui says, everyone knows she feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:57.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were looking for someone who would support you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.07,0:10:01.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and that's like second nature to Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}If you and Taichi got together, everything would be just peachy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:10.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that happened, we'd stay together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just stupid.\NJust because everything would be peachy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:18.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that Inaba Himeko was {\i1}this{\i0} stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:22.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was always alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:25.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Always, {\i1}always{\i0} alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:30.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then I got to high school, and I finally met people I could call my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:34.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to lose them, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't know what else to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.61,0:10:39.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think I'd know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're lonely, then tell someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're anxious, then tell someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The world isn't made of people who can analyze others like you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}If you want people to know something, you need to tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Embarrassed or worried or whatever, just tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think I could?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:11:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I showed any sign of weakness, no one would need me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.97,0:11:06.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't have a choice!\NTell me, what could I have done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:08.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't need to do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.47,0:11:09.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:13.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A person like me... An awful, horrible person—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call yourself a horrible person!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:16.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about yourself like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:18.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not a good person like the rest of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is that supposed to make me feel since I {\i1}love{\i0} you for who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:38.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you, Inaban.\NI really love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:41.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you won't believe me, I'll say it until you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it's not just me. Everyone loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's not the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the strong, infallible Inaba Himeko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll love you no matter how weak you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:58.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.\NYou're wrong, Inaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a better person than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's wrong, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}There aren't any "good" or "bad" people. You can't just slap a label on people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trust me.\NIf you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you think that I'm a good person, then trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have my word!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Inaban.\NYou don't need to do anything crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:29.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll always be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's not exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.85,0:12:35.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll always {\i1}want{\i0} to be your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:38.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please! Let me be your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.23,0:12:42.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...\NI've always wanted someone to tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:58.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd just get in the way of you and Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:02.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to ruin the CRC.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I can't go back to the club room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?\NWhy can't you go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:13.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because everything would be way too awkward.\NI just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Inaban, you said that if Taichi and I got together, everything would be just peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:23.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you and Taichi got together,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,wouldn't everything be just peachy then, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:29.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you and Taichi make a good couple,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:35.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I didn't even care much for Taichi at first, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, I still don't—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you lie to yourself like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I know you're trying to do everything you can to keep the five of us together,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}but now you love Taichi so much that you just can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:57.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}The Inaba Himeko I know would do whatever it took to keep both!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:14:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how bad it got, she'd never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:04.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arrogant to the end, with no respect for anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,controlling people for her own benefit and getting her way no matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's{\i0} Inaba Himeko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:12.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And even if you get your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:17.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the friendship between Nagase Iori and Inaba Himeko won't end over one lousy guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:22.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:28.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you can come back to the club room worry-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't come crying to me if you don't like it.\NDon't underestimate me, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:44.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's how you want it, I'll make my victory a flawless one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There won't even be a hair on his head left for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:49.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't plan on losing or giving him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:52.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really think you can beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are {\i1}plenty{\i0} of ways to beat a girl who's got nothing but being cute going for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:14:58.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were really emotional just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:07.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.25,0:15:09.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, when did my desires stop being un—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:13.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:18.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that bullshit.\NWhat the hell are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:31.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to tell you that this desire unleashing phenomenon is about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:34.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,End? So it's all over now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there was a little accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:43.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought it might be interesting—\NI mean, best if I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:49.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaegashi-san fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:49.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:52.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He fell.\NYaegashi-san fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:56.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fell?\NYou don't mean... from there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Taichi! Taichi! Taichi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:11.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a bit different from Nagase-san's case.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:14.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't do anything this time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did you call it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being a selfless freak?{\i0}\N{\i1}It's quite something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:30.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:33.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't make us worry like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We freaked out and ran all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.30,0:16:39.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Yeah! Yui and I were having a great time cleaning up together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:41.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:47.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Inaba?\NWhat's wrong? You're all red.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wasn't Nagase-san with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:54.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Can you believe it? Taichi went and did something stupid again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He tried to help a kitten that got stuck in a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then he fell from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:04.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's the cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:08.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just fine.\NIt doesn't look like she got injured. She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:10.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That goes for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:14.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously. You're always making us worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:21.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least we can look back on this and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:24.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:32.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't make me worry, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to hit me so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:44.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry!\NDon't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:48.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I did, but I'm sorry!\NI apologize!\NSo stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:51.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay? Taichi's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:58.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you that worried about him?\NYou don't need to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:00.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to cry, Inaba-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I finally made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori, where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know where I was, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.81,0:18:10.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, what happened to Inaban?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your guess is as good as ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:17.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba, I don't know what I did, but I'm sorry!\NI'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba, you don't need to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:22.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi's just fine, Inaba-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban? Inaban?\NWhat's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the whole "desire unleashing" thing is finally over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:42.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's going to be hell trying to catch up with work on the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But is it really over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.47,0:18:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NIf something else comes up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.02,0:18:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no point in worrying about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:55.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's important is that we're free right now. Let's enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:19:00.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously, how does someone end up as laid-back as you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are Taichi and Inaba-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think Fujishima-san is giving them an earful for what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe.\NThen I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:10.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we should go home first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:28.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:32.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanted to talk to me about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:43.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... Er...\NUh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.01,0:20:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:07.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy that you feel that way about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:10.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I consider it an honor, from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But right now, I'm in love with Nagase.{...}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:21.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But "right now" means that I have a chance to turn that around.{:D}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:28.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... that's not exactly what I—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:32.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're not going out with Iori yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.41,0:20:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting between you is easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.41,0:20:39.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I told Iori that I'd be confessing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.29,0:20:41.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a fair race to the finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:47.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to mind either of us.\NJust go about your business as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait! You're way ahead of me here.\NWhat do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:55.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you and Nagase are going to fight over—{!!!}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it to me once before.\NTurnabout's fair play, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:08.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the club room tomorrow.\NSee you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:31.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shoot!\NMy heart!\NI kissed him!{kyaa!}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:52.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.37,0:21:56.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himeko, what happened? You never say anything when you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:21:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up, stupid.
